{"id":"n62843-2-6","stage":0,"title":"아이 · 孩子","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62843-2-6-1","ko":"자녀는 몇이나 두셨어요?","zh":"您一共有几个孩子呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자녀는","meaning":"子女","explanation":"자녀：子女；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"자녀","audio":"/audio/fb699cb7a0a6e3007f52.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24770","senseId":"1","lemma":"자녀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자녀는","audio":"/audio/1495318a7fdc543476f4.mp3"}},{"text":"몇이나","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几、多少；-이나 接在疑问数词后，这里询问有几个孩子，并强调数量。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇이나","audio":"/audio/e390eafffd1a7c020188.mp3"}},{"text":"두셨어요?","meaning":"有（子女）","explanation":"두다：这里指有子女；-시- 是主语敬语，-었어요 是礼貌形式，这里询问对方有几个孩子。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"20","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두셨어요","audio":"/audio/4b31593d524ad72dd864.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fb699cb7a0a6e300","term":"자녀","zh":"子女","audio":"/audio/fb699cb7a0a6e3007f52.mp3","entryId":"24770","definition":"父母养育的儿子或女儿；或指儿子和女儿。","pronunciation":["자녀"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"有（子女）","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"把某人作为家人；这里指有子女。","pronunciation":["두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a39c1d81ca41a0f5746c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62843-2-6-2","ko":"저희 부부는 아직 아이가 없어요.","zh":"我们夫妻还没有孩子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们。","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231"